    {
      "id": "chushu-c1",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "二十四节气按太阳位置划分一年。",
        "en": "The 24 solar terms divide the year by the Sun's position."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国"
      ],
      "period": "现行口径（GB/T 33661-2017 时代）；机制承自传统历法",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-pmo-almanac-qa",
        "source-hko-solar-terms"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-solarterms-calendar-role"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "chushu-c2",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "处暑是第十四个节气。太阳到达黄经150°，炎热开始退去。",
        "en": "Chushu is the fourteenth term: the Sun reaches 150°. Heat begins to retreat."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；日期经验因纬度而异"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文学口径；2017年起有国家标准表述",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-chushu-feature",
        "source-xinhua-chushu-2022"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-chushu-longitude-150"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "chushu-c3",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "处暑是农历七月的\"中气\"。\"处\"是\"终止\"——暑天到此为止。",
        "en": "Chushu is the mid-term of the seventh lunar month. \"Chu\" means \"end\" — summer heat concludes."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国（传统历法编算规则）"
      ],
      "period": "现行农历编算口径；GB/T 33661-2017 为现行国家标准（正文条款待人工核读）",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-pmo-almanac-qa",
        "source-yueling-qishierhou-wikisource"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-solarterms-jieqi-zhongqi"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "chushu-c4",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "气温逐渐下降。\"秋老虎\"可能短暂回热，但趋势是转凉。",
        "en": "Temperatures gradually fall. \"Autumn tiger\" heat may linger, but the trend is cooling."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国分区（长城以北/华北中南部黄淮/南方/华西/东南沿海）；概述级，未附逐年气象数据"
      ],
      "period": "\"常年\"口径（中国天气网2026）；谚语层为民闲传统",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-weathercn-chushu-2026",
        "source-xinhua-chushu-2022"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-chushu-climate-autumn-transition"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "chushu-c5",
      "kind": "fact",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "古人观察到：鹰开始捕猎、天地间的气变得清肃、庄稼成熟了。",
        "en": "Ancient texts: hawks hunt, heaven and earth grow solemn, grains ripen."
      },
      "region": [
        "文本经验锚定中国（黄河流域为核心的古典物候传统）；实际物候因纬度海拔而异"
      ],
      "period": "文本传统题名为元代；所承物候体系更早（《礼记·月令》《吕氏春秋》等）",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-yueling-qishierhou-wikisource"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "hist-yueling-chushu-pentads"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "chushu-c6",
      "kind": "tradition",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "沿海地区庆祝开渔节；民间吃鸭子进补。",
        "en": "Coastal communities celebrate the fishing season opening; people eat duck for nourishment."
      },
      "region": [
        "机构汇编叙述（北京保留至今为重点标注）；无古籍直读，地域谱系未核"
      ],
      "period": "当代机构汇编（2017）；古籍层缺",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-chushu-feature"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
